    "date": "2023-07-26",
    "text": "2. Ando - AI by @RemitNotPaucity\n\nThis Figma plugin helps you generate millions of design ideas from prompts, shapes, and images.\n\nGet it here: https://t.co/VT8dLUq0nV https://t.co/0BJvq41oQS\n\n3. MockRocket by @DerekFeehrer\n\nA Figma plugin to create 3D mockups, simply drag to rotate the device in true 3D and directly export.\n\nGet it here: https://t.co/KrOjmPLpfB https://t.co/j5d9g06ekJ\n\n4. Google Sheets Sync by @DavidWilliames\n\nThis plugin helps you import data directly from Google sheet to Figma.\n\nGet it here: https://t.co/TCKV6C9sCP https://t.co/kikwudLOAX\n\n5. Beautiful Shadows by @alexwidua\n\nThis plugin allows you to create beautiful shadows by simply dragging a 'light source' which casts a shadow on selected elements.\n\nGet it here: https://t.co/sVC2JjtGuT https://t.co/6NikGVw9hK\n\n6. Humation by @ysk_en\n\nGet a collection of customized hand-drawn illustrations inside your Figma.\n\nGet it here: https://t.co/9oMCVr4jNa https://t.co/Dd769xdMZ0\n\nI hope you've found this thread helpful.\n\nFollow me @ADPList for more.\n\nLike/Retweet the first tweet below if you can: https://t.co/4wUpXBPlQe",
    "thread": [
      {
        "id": "1683990991727136768",
        "text": "2. Ando - AI by @RemitNotPaucity\n\nThis Figma plugin helps you generate millions of design ideas from prompts, shapes, and images.\n\nGet it here: https://t.co/VT8dLUq0nV https://t.co/0BJvq41oQS"
      },
      {
        "id": "1683991024505593856",
        "text": "3. MockRocket by @DerekFeehrer\n\nA Figma plugin to create 3D mockups, simply drag to rotate the device in true 3D and directly export.\n\nGet it here: https://t.co/KrOjmPLpfB https://t.co/j5d9g06ekJ"
      },
      {
        "id": "1683991066050179074",
        "text": "4. Google Sheets Sync by @DavidWilliames\n\nThis plugin helps you import data directly from Google sheet to Figma.\n\nGet it here: https://t.co/TCKV6C9sCP https://t.co/kikwudLOAX"
      },
      {
        "id": "1683991097218076672",
        "text": "5. Beautiful Shadows by @alexwidua\n\nThis plugin allows you to create beautiful shadows by simply dragging a 'light source' which casts a shadow on selected elements.\n\nGet it here: https://t.co/sVC2JjtGuT https://t.co/6NikGVw9hK"
      },
      {
        "id": "1683991128595644417",
        "text": "6. Humation by @ysk_en\n\nGet a collection of customized hand-drawn illustrations inside your Figma.\n\nGet it here: https://t.co/9oMCVr4jNa https://t.co/Dd769xdMZ0"
      },
      {
        "id": "1683991132248875013",
        "text": "I hope you've found this thread helpful.\n\nFollow me @ADPList for more.\n\nLike/Retweet the first tweet below if you can: https://t.co/4wUpXBPlQe"
      }
